## Interface: 16001
## Title: The Shit List
## Notes: Remember the players you loved and the ones you'd rather not see again. Right-click a player to rate them; get warned when they join your group.
## Author: Hexx
## Version: 0.4.0
## SavedVariables: TheShitListDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: TheShitListBackup

# WoW Forever beta workaround: the client's SavedVariables loader is broken (writes fine,
# never reads back). SV_Account / SV_Char are directory junctions to the real
# SavedVariables folders (account-wide / Hexx), so these run the saved files as addon
# code and the list loads anyway. Without the junctions they're simply skipped.
SV_Account\TheShitList.lua
SV_Char\TheShitList.lua

TheShitList.lua
TheShitList_Window.lua
TheShitList_Rate.lua
